oks almost as bad, but she's stolen, and prefers using the masks of many beautiful women, most of whom died horribly when Zanna selflessly tried to help them fly.<br /> <br /> Zanna sometimes sees these dead women as adoring members of her court, all of them thanking her for their brief moment of flight. <br /> <br /> These women are a manifestations of her zero clarity and so powerful is her Wyrd that her mein manifest her delusions within any space up to 20 feet away from her, so upon seeing them talking to Zanna so some Changelings falsely assume these women were ghosts, until several Gravewrights corrected them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","user":"Omegaphallic","date":". 03-25-2016, 10:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-25T19:33:37-07:00","id":853283,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/841320-2e-changeling-characters?p=853268#post853268\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sweet Release sounds more like a massage parlour then a name for a strip club, as Sweet Release suggests a happy ending so you might attract more clients looking for menu/extras then if it had another name.<br /> <br /> But it would be 